  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Nightmare Hunt",
    "summary": "In the Battle-shock step of the opposing player's Command phase, each enemy unit that is under its Starting Strength and within 12\" of any HERETIC ASTARTES unit of yours has to take a Battle-shock test with 1 subtracted from the result; an enemy unit this rule has affected need not take further Battle-shock tests in that phase. Attacks by your HERETIC ASTARTES models get +1 on Hit rolls against Below Half-strength targets and +1 on Wound rolls against Battle-shocked targets. When an attack targets one of your HERETIC ASTARTES units and the model making it is Battle-shocked, its Hit roll gets -1.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "app",
